    SERVICE AGREEMENT
  </heading>
  <text>
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="69"/>
    <location value="459"/>
    <location value="95"/>
<![CDATA[This Service Agreement (the "Agreement") is made on 1 March 2026 between Northwind Analytics AS, Oslo, Norway (the "Supplier"), and Riverbank Logistics Ltd, Leeds, United Kingdom (the "Customer").]]>  </text>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="110"/>
    <location value="114"/>
    <location value="116"/>
    1. Services
  </heading>
  <text>
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="124"/>
    <location value="459"/>
    <location value="141"/>
    1.1 The Supplier shall provide hosting, monitoring and support for the data platform of the Customer, as described in this Agreement.
  </text>
  <text>
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="148"/>
    <location value="459"/>
    <location value="163"/>
    1.2 Support is available on business days from 08:00 to 18:00 CET. Critical incidents are answered within 2 hours.
  </text>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="179"/>
    <location value="172"/>
    <location value="187"/>
    2. Fees and Payment
  </heading>
  <text>
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="194"/>
    <location value="377"/>
    <location value="200"/>
    2.1 The Customer shall pay the monthly fees in Table 1. The fees exclude VAT.
  </text>
