  <heading level="2">
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="51"/>
    <location value="199"/>
    <location value="58"/>
    3. Term and Termination
  </heading>
  <text>
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="66"/>
    <location value="459"/>
    <location value="82"/>
    3.1 This Agreement has an initial term of 24 months. It renews automatically for successive periods of 12 months, unless terminated.
  </text>
  <text>
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="89"/>
    <location value="459"/>
    <location value="104"/>
    3.2 Either party may terminate this Agreement by written notice of at least 90 days before the end of the current term.
  </text>
  <text>
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="113"/>
    <location value="411"/>
    <location value="120"/>
    3.3 The Supplier may suspend the services if an invoice is more than 45 days overdue.
  </text>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="134"/>
    <location value="116"/>
    <location value="142"/>
    4. Liability
  </heading>
  <text>
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="149"/>
    <location value="459"/>
    <location value="165"/>
    4.1 The total liability of the Supplier is limited to the fees paid in the 12 months before the claim. Neither party is liable for:
  </text>
  <list>
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="80"/>
    <location value="172"/>
    <location value="214"/>
    <location value="179"/>
    indirect or consequential losses;
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="80"/>
    <location value="182"/>
    <location value="182"/>
    <location value="188"/>
    loss of profit or revenue;
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="80"/>
    <location value="192"/>
    <location value="441"/>
    <location value="198"/>
    loss of data, except where caused by a breach of the backup obligations of the Supplier.
  </list>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="213"/>
    <location value="155"/>
    <location value="221"/>
    5. Governing Law
  </heading>
  <text>
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="228"/>
    <location value="459"/>
    <location value="242"/>
    5.1 This Agreement is governed by the laws of Norway. Disputes are settled by the Oslo District Court.
  </text>
